      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Whenever I'm expecting a lot of company",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Haven't had a lot of company in a long time",
          "rhyme": "ajm",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "But if I were expecting some",
          "rhyme": "om",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I'd whip up a really—ugh!—substantial meal!",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "You see how strong I am!? Heh",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "It's from eating all this stuff",
          "rhyme": "9f",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Good healthy meal like the... fillet!",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Now that's what they call soul food",
          "rhyme": "ud",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Now you got black-eyed peas",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Carrot greens, collard greens",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Cornbread, watermelon",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "And for dessert...",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Pork butts",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Hahahahahahahaha!",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Eat heartily gentlemen",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "I got a really stressful day and I really, really needed some food",
          "rhyme": "ud",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Something healthy like beets",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Showed you how good it is",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Well you may say \"I don't think I'd care for that\"",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "So you could also fix yourself a...",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEFGHIJKLMINHOGII",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCADEFGBAHFBBFGAFBB"
    }
  ]
